check     8 of 8 rule applications on the machine agree with the rule
rule      1,000 iterations from h = 8, c = 0
          h even 499 times (c + 2), odd 501 times (c - 1)
          balance c = 497, smallest 2
          h has 588 bits

The balance did not become negative in 1,000 iterations.
Whether it ever does is an open problem, so nobody knows whether Antihydra halts.
The question is close to Mahler's 3/2 problem.
